cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AgentDDx: When Agentic Retrieval Fails to Help"
message: "If you use this software or its released evaluation logs, please cite the accompanying paper."
type: software
# Authors are withheld while the accompanying paper is under double-blind review.
# Replace this block with the author list before the camera-ready release.
authors:
  - name: "The AgentDDx Authors"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An agentic differential-diagnosis system and a paired evaluation showing that
  retrieval does not improve closed-form medical question answering for a strong
  LLM, and that added pipeline sophistication degrades it.
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - medical question answering
  - agentic systems
  - MedQA
